Hi Tom.

 > I get compile errors compiling call.c in ax25-apps-0.0.6 because 
 > it cannot find curses.h - What package(s) am I missing?

If you're running any version of Red Hat Linux or Mandrake Linux
or Eridani Linux you want the ncurses-devel RPM package...

	rpm -q ncurses-devel

I can't speak for other distributions, although I see somebody has
already posted the relevant details for Debian Linux...

Best wishes from Riley.
